  "obWelcomeTitle": "Welcome! 👋",
  "obWelcomeBody": "PETS 🐾 is a simple app that helps you manage recurring tasks.\n\nEverything has 3 levels: at the top you define a group (like Home). Inside it you can define items or topics (Cleaning, Garden), and items get recurring tasks (clean the air conditioner screens every 3 months, water the plants every 4 days).\n\nThere is no right way to define items and assign them to groups - organize it however suits you.",
  "obNext": "Next",
  "obSkip": "Skip",
  "obGotIt": "Got it",
  "obGroupsTitle": "Group and item buttons",
  "obGroupsBody": "These buttons filter the tasks below to the selected group or item. On the main page you see all your groups - long-press a group to open, edit or delete it. On a group page you see all of its items.",
  "obFabTitle": "Add everything from here",
  "obFabBody": "A top-level group, an item inside a group, and of course recurring tasks.",
  "obMenuTitle": "Organize and settings",
  "obMenuBody": "Go to Settings and to the Organize groups and items screen: edit, delete and reorder there - including the examples when you are done with them.",
  "obDoneTitle": "All set! 🐾",
  "obDoneBody": "Phone reminders and Google Calendar sync are turned on per task, when you create or edit it. The calendar gets a single event, on the next due date of the task. You can replay this tour in Settings → About.",
  "obReplay": "How it works",
  "obCardTitle": "This is today’s task",
  "obCardBody": "This screen shows all your tasks in the order they are due: today first, then tomorrow, and so on. Tap the task card to open it and see more details and actions.",
  "obCompleteTitle": "Done? Tap \"Complete\"",
  "obCompleteBody": "Try it now - tap the button.",
  "obNextDueTitle": "The due date was updated",
  "obAnalysisButtonTitle": "Want to see how you are doing?",
  "obAnalysisButtonBody": "Tap the highlighted button to open the task analysis page.",
  "obAnalysisTitle": "Performance analysis",
  "obAnalysisBody": "This page tracks one task and analyzes how you do it, with charts and metrics. Each section opens to show more - tap the different sections. When you are done, go back and the tour will continue.",
  "obManualTitle": "Log a completion date manually",
  "obManualBody": "Forgot to mark it in time? Pick the date you actually did it. (You can delete completions in the history at the bottom of the analysis page.)",
  "obDuplicateTitle": "Duplicate task",
  "obDuplicateBody": "Opens a new-task window with the same settings as this task, to edit and confirm. Handy when similar tasks belong to different items.",
  "obEditTitle": "Edit task",
  "obEditBody": "Name, frequency, reminder, calendar and the next due date - and deleting the task.",
  "sampleItemCat": "Cat 🐱",
  "obDrawerTitle": "The side menu",
  "obDrawerBody": "Quick switching between pages: the All groups page, which is the main page with no filters, and a page for every group you create.",
  "obBrowse": "Got it, let me look",
  "obStartCardTitle": "Want to get to know PETS 🐾?",
  "obStartCardBody": "Tap \"Start\" and we will create two example groups, Home and Pets, with a \"Garden\" item in the Home group and a plant-watering task that already has a few weeks of history. The guide walks through every action and takes about 2-3 minutes.\n\nPrefer to start on your own? ✕ closes this offer. You can always replay the tour in Settings → About.",
